<object id="legend" label="Legend — independently numbered flows&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0072B2&quot;&gt;A · Write / metadata sync: publish content and metadata events, poll, upsert.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#D55E00&quot;&gt;B · Read / retrieval: query metadata, retrieve S3 content, save once, return blob reference.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;Filled arrow = caller → callee. Normal responses are folded into request labels. Dashed = auxiliary query (B1); solid = main call.&lt;br&gt;“async” qualifies metadata publication; it does not change the line style. Three queues and three corresponding listeners are shown individually.&lt;br&gt;Cosmos DB stores metadata; S3 and temporary Blob Storage hold document content." annotationKind="legend"><mxCell vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=18;fillColor=#F3F6F9;strokeColor=#9AA8B6;" annotationKind="legend"><mxGeometry x="80" y="2100" width="3630" height="240" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
